# Line endings: keep build outputs (and text in general) LF-normalized in
# the index so the CI dist-drift gate compares byte-identical files across
# OSes — vite preserves source line endings, so a CRLF checkout would emit
# CRLF html and fail the gate on Linux/macOS.
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.d.ts text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
